{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p>&nbsp;? <strong>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn:<\/strong>&nbsp;h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean xem video, l\u01b0u \u00fd \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc (\u00e2m On, \u00e2m Kun), c\u00e1ch vi\u1ebft, c\u00e1ch ghi nh\u1edb ch\u1eef H\u00e1n.<br>* L\u01b0u \u00fd: h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o danh s\u00e1ch t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng v\u00e0 ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p \u1edf d\u01b0\u1edbi video tr\u01b0\u1edbc\/ trong khi xem.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp;? <strong>M\u1ed9t ch\u00fat v\u1ec1 ch\u1eef H\u00e1n:<\/strong><\/p><p>+ L\u1ecbch s\u1eed: ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c t\u1eeb Trung Qu\u1ed1c, nh\u01b0ng&nbsp;<i>Kanji<\/i>&nbsp;\u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt kh\u00f4ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng v\u1edbi ch\u1eef H\u00e1n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi Trung Qu\u1ed1c, m\u00e0 c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t \u00e2m, c\u00e1ch vi\u1ebft c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a ch\u1eef H\u00e1n \u0111\u00f3.<\/p><p>+ L\u1ee3i \u00edch: Kanji gi\u00fap d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t c\u00e1c t\u1eeb ng\u1eef trong c\u00e2u, l\u00e0m cho c\u00e2u v\u0103n d\u1ec5 \u0111\u1ecdc h\u01a1n. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec3u kh\u00e1t qu\u00e1t n\u1ed9i dung c\u00e2u v\u0103n d\u1ef1a v\u00e0o \u00fd ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a ch\u1eef H\u00e1n.<\/p><p>+ C\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc: Khi du nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n, c\u00e1c ch\u1eef H\u00e1n c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u00f4i ch\u00fat v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t \u00e2m \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt. Theo \u0111\u00f3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi Nh\u1eadt c\u00f3&nbsp;<i>hai c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc&nbsp;<\/i>Kanji&nbsp;l\u00e0 \u201conyomi\u201d (\u97f3\u8aad\u307f) v\u00e0 \u201ckunyomi\u201d (\u8a13\u8aad\u307f).<\/p><ol><li>Onyomi l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc theo \u00e2m H\u00e1n Nh\u1eadt, th\u01b0\u1eddng d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ecdc c\u00e1c t\u1eeb vay m\u01b0\u1ee3n t\u1eeb Trung Qu\u1ed1c (th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 t\u1eeb gh\u00e9p, c\u00e1c c\u00e2u th\u00e0nh ng\u1eef 4 ch\u1eef).&nbsp;<\/li><li>kunyomi - \u0111\u1ecdc theo<i>&nbsp;<\/i>\u00e2m thu\u1ea7n Nh\u1eadt \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng t\u1eeb g\u1ed1c Nh\u1eadt (t\u1eeb \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n trong ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt, ch\u1ec9 m\u01b0\u1ee3n m\u1eb7t ch\u1eef H\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb \u00fd ngh\u0129a).<\/li><\/ol><p>?&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;\u30d5\u30e9\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9 (Flash cards):<\/strong><\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><div class=\"raw-html-embed\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center\">\r\n<iframe src=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/presentation\/d\/e\/2PACX-1vROY5FKrz0UvTVRji7mPtVvyWNIJSlz38YkGv9sli4dxUT9KMT0X3hgOlLfm-m81g\/embed?start=false&amp;loop=false&amp;delayms=3000\" frameborder=\"0\" width=\"749\" height=\"479\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" mozallowfullscreen=\"true\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"true\"><\/iframe>\r\n<\/div><\/div><p>&nbsp;<\/p><h3 style=\"text-align:center;\">\u30e6\u30cb\u30c3\u30c8\uff14\u30fb\u6f22\u5b57\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8<\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center;\">UNIT 4 - DANH S\u00c1CH H\u00c1N T\u1ef0<\/h3><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:100%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\";\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:4.72%;\"><col style=\"width:8.97%;\"><col style=\"width:9.33%;\"><col style=\"width:10.26%;\"><col style=\"width:17.47%;\"><col style=\"width:12.27%;\"><col style=\"width:36.98%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#efefef;border:1px solid #000000;padding:2px 3px;text-align:center;\"><strong>#<\/strong><\/td><td style=\"background-color:#efefef;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;border-right:1px solid #000000;border-top:1px solid #000000;padding:2px 3px;text-align:center;\"><strong>Ka